  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">수업내용과 관련은 거의 없지만 눈에 관한 내용 배우기 전에 잠시 해도 좋겠어요.</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rh5bQTrFH68\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single;\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rh5bQTrFH68</span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">[</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">착시현상</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">] </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">시력이 나쁜 사람만 보이는 그림 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cA5OiI03bDE\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single;\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cA5OiI03bDE</span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">여러분은 얼마나 섬세한 눈을 갖고 계신가요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? (</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">눈 테스트</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)  </span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
